<title>USA: Transport America forms subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Transport America forms subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport Corp of America Inc said Tuseday it formed a new, wholly owned subsidiary, Transport International Express Inc.</p>
<p>The new unit will offer expedited less-than-truckload service between major markets in the United States. It will partner with freight forwarders and airlines to provide an expedited logistic service tailored to specific customer requirements.</p>
<p>Transport Corp is a truckload carrier providing logistics services to major customers in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
